# The lis-web build context is this repo (scripts/web-image.ps1); the Dockerfile copies only
# web/package.json, web/package-lock.json, web/server.mjs and web/tools/. Kept out:
# binaries, models, logs (logs/api-key), bench results, the web keys and node_modules.
.git/
bin/
models/
logs/
bench/results/
web/node_modules/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/__pycache__/
